{
  "name": "projects/app-int-templates-prod/locations/global/templates/connection-tool",
  "displayName": "Connection Tool",
  "description": "Use this single flow template to access all connections within this project from Google Agent Development Kit to perform agentic actions on your enterprise application.",
  "usageInfo": "1. Name the integration created as “ExecuteConnection”  \n2. To use in ADK, just publish the integration as-is without any change  \n3. Additional details about the flow  \n   1. API trigger: Triggers are required to start the sequence of tasks that make up an integration.  \n   2. Connector Task: This task dynamically executes operations based on your runtime inputs.   \n   3. Data Mapping: It maps the received data and returns the connectorOutputPayload.",
